<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak cbank forex reserves slip to $2.999 bln.</title>
<headline>Slovak cbank forex reserves slip to $2.999 bln.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) said on Friday its hard currency reserves totalled $2.999 billion as of July 2, down from $3.018 billion on June 25.</p>
<p>  SLOVAK FOREX RESERVES    July 2    June 25   Dec 31/96</p>
<p>   NBS reserves ($bln)	2.999     3.018	3.473</p>
<p>   Commercial banks	   2.778     2.158	2.321</p>
<p>   Entire banking sector    5.777     5.176	5.794</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 421-7-521-8402</p>
</text>
